While it is important to point out the word/object distinction, it is proba=
bly a lost cause in Lojban (as it is in English and logic textbooks). =A0Ev=
ery time any systematic attempt is made to fix this distinction, the new ex=
pressions are collapsed together again: term, predicate, function,. argumen=
t, and so on. =A0One is tempted (for more reasons than just this) to go bac=
k to "noun" and "verb" for the words.




